window.products.push({"id":263018,"name":"Signature Housewares Word Collection Cookie Jar, 48-Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmiThg-XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Word Cookie Jar is part of a Collection that goes in a new direction. Straight and to the point. Each piece is adorned with one simple word in cursive writing and subtle ridges that add to the character. Constructed of glazed stoneware - a dense, strong and durable ceramic that is especially appropriate for functional ware. These vessels are dishwasher-safe and designed for everyday use. Choose from a variety of colors and coordinate your look with a wide range of Signature serving pieces and accessories. Signature Housewares - fashionable, functional products that combine exceptional value and quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kmiThg-XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Housewares","source_asin":"B00IGNP8L4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IGNP8L4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IGNP8L4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":263019,"name":"LANGXUN 7.2ft Golden Metal Circle Balloon Arch Stand Decoration, for Birthday Party Decoration, Wedding Decor, Graduation Decorations and Baby Girl Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nfIjBv9ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please Watch The Video Installation Instructions Before Purchasing The Installation. HIGH QUALITY - MATERIAL: Iron / COLOR: Gold / SIZE: 7.2 x 7.2 ft, Brand Name:LANGXUN. The material of the arch is iron, durable, corrosion-resistant, can be reused several times, environmental protection and sanitation, and does not take up space. ATMOSPHERE BUILDER - Arch decoration is one of the most popular party decorations nowadays. Take a look at the arches on ins and tiktok,you can decorate it with balloons, flowers, fake plants or LED light pendants or other elements to create a personalized backdrop for the arch. It can be used indoors or outdoors. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS OCCASIONS - Birthday party, bachelor party, boy & girl baby showers, school opening ceremonies, graduation party decoration, candy buffets, dessert tables, christmas decoration, New Years Decoration, Commercial celebration decorationand Party Photo Booth. You Can Reuse It On Various Occasions. EASY TO ASSEMBLE - It can be quickly assembled in minutes. With the product we are equipped with balloon ring, dot glue and balloon tape strip accessories to help you build your own arch decoration more easily and quickly. BEST CUSTOMER SERVICE - This Will Be A Shopping Without Worry. If The Product You Receive Has Any Quality Problems, Is Not Satisfied Or Damaged In Use, Please Contact Us, We Will Give You 100% Unconditional Refund. Tip: If you want to use plastic rings to build a balloon arch, for best results, we recommend using 5 inch balloons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nfIjBv9ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANGXUN","source_asin":"B08PTV67MT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PTV67MT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PTV67MT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":263020,"name":"LaBrinx Designs 2-Pack Medium Suction Cup Shelf - Live Plants, Windows, and Bathrooms","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RAlURVm0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTRASTRONG SUCTION CUPS: Designed with strategic knobs to hold up to 5lbs indefinitely, the reinforced suction cups will be sure to keep your favorite succulents or flowers exactly where you want them. It can even be used as a bird feeder outdoors! CLEAR DESIGN: Measuring 10” wide by 3.5” deep, there is the perfect amount of space for your Bonsai plants or herbs! This compact, clear shelf enables you to place it nearly anywhere, such as on your bathroom mirror or in the shower! GREAT FOR GIFTS: This useful shelf will make any gardener, chef, interior designer, or bird enthusiast happy and will last for years to come. Our shelves are simple, clean and elegant enough for any space. MULTIUSE SHELVES: We designed these storage shelves to work in a variety of locations for multiple different tasks. Perfect for holding your spices and seasonings in your kitchen, shower accessories in your bathroom, or for your pet turtles terrarium. EASY INSTALL AND USE: To install this decorative shelf, make sure you have a smooth, level surface. For the most adhesive result, firmly press on the suction cups. To remove, simply use a dull prying tool such as a flathead to break the seal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RAlURVm0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LaBrinx Designs","source_asin":"B06ZZD4F52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZD4F52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZD4F52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
