window.products.push({"id":263025,"name":"Flexrake FLX139 Forged Pro Grape Shear Curved Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BbOE5rU9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bypass design has been the benchmark of the best pruners. Now we have made a good thing even better - thanks to exceptional quality and extended life. This tool is made of high carbon steel and is drop-forged under more than 5,000 ponds of pressure to improve the grain structure. One endothermic heat treating process at over 2000 F brings the finished parts to an exacting hardness qualification for incomparable strength and durability. This tool is our landscape series heavy grade bypass pruner, harvesting shear. The blade of this shear is curved in shape to reach around fruit and make a close cut. Enjoy our quality and enjoy your garden.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BbOE5rU9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexrake","source_asin":"B004OBZG46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004OBZG46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004OBZG46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
