window.products.push({"id":263343,"name":"Baking Sheet with Silicone Mat Set of 4 [2 Sheets + 2 Mats], Deedro Stainless Steel Cookie Sheet Baking Pan with Silicone Baking Mat, 10 x 8 x 1 Inch,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714G9tPQ0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍎 [PERFECT BAKING SET] You will get 4 pieces, including 2 baking sheets - 10.43 x 8.07 x 1 inch, 2 silicone baking mats - 9.45 x 6.89 inch. Great for baking, roasting, broiling and cooking in your regular oven and toaster oven. Single pan / silicone pad use or use them together for oven. It will be your good helper for all your favorite meals and food recipes. 🍎 [ENJOY HEALTHY COOKING] Deedro baking sheets are constructed with pure stainless steel without any deleterious impurities or chemical coating, PTFE, PFOA, BPA and rust free. You needn't worry about coating flaking off or noxious material leaching into your food, great substitution of aluminum pan, healthy and safe for daily use. Smooth rolled edge and round corner without rough spot for comfortably hold and transfer. 🍎 [NONSTICK SILICONE MAT] The mats are made of 100% food grade silicone and reinforced fiberglass. They are soft, durable, with high elasticity and tear resistant, making it can be used repeatedly. Our non-stick silicone baking mats prevent baked food from sticking and replace the waste of parchment paper and the needs for grease, butter and oil sprays. You can knead, prepare, bake, or cool your delicate baked goods on the mat. 🍎 [ADVANCED CRAFT] Thick gauge with sturdy construction, these heavy-duty half sheet pans have a reinforced, rolled edge that provides extra strength to help resist warping in the oven. 1-inch deep rim avoid food juice flowing everywhere, keep your oven neat. Shiny and attractive mirror finished surface provides effortless release of baked goods. Both the cookie sheet and mat are easy clean and dishwasher safe. 🍎 [VERSATILE BAKEWARE KIT] The oven pans and silicone mats are great for using separately or together. Perfect for baking cookies, breads, bacon, steaks, vegetables, ribs, chicken wings, drumsticks, brownies, pizza and more. The silicone pastry mats are non-stick and include a circular guide with metrics to ensure perfection when baking, great for any baking recipes and eliminate the need for butter, oils and sprays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714G9tPQ0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deedro","source_asin":"B08PBCR112","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBCR112","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBCR112","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
