window.products.push({"id":263399,"name":"Oriental Furniture 6\" Sitting Laughing Buddha Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917xyhGVMGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The classic oriental folk deity, called Hotei in Japanese traditions, and Budai in Chinese, the \"Laughing Buddha\" in the America. Distinct from the Gautama Buddha, the meditation Buddha, this round, bald gentleman is thought to have been a Zen Buddhist monk. He traveled the Far East in the 10th century, spreading happiness and good fortune; a herald of contentment and good luck. A traditional gift for birthdays, New Year, housewarmings, new beginnings. In Japanese tradition, Hotei is considered one of the Seven Lucky Gods. In much of the Far East, statues of Hotei or Budai are thought to bring good fortune and felicity to the household or business. Statues of Laughing Buddha are thought to bestow wishes if the belly is rubbed while the supplicant, with pure heart, makes a silent wish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917xyhGVMGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIENTAL Furniture","source_asin":"B0049WLOTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0049WLOTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0049WLOTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
