window.products.push({"id":263509,"name":"Birthdate Candles, March 31 - Aries Zodiac Scented Candles Birthday Gift - Mint, Geranium & Cedarwood Scent - All-Natural Soy & Coconut Wax, 60-80 Hou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lqHPDVG6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The March Thirty-First Birthday Candle: Born in Aries and ruled by Mars and number 4, the children of March Thirty-First are calm and steady individuals. This candle offers a thrilling scent to stir the spirits of the energetic, passionate, and dynamic souls born on this date. Combining astrology, numerology, and tarot, we created unique candles for every birthday, each featuring a carefully designed fragrance. 13.5 ounces with a 60-80 hour burn time. Candles Inspired by the Stars: Your Zodiac sign, emblematic tarot card, ruling number and ruling planet help to illuminate your key strengths and vulnerabilities, profile your personality and relationships, and provide guidance to help you on your path in the universe. A Custom Scent to Match Your Energy: Each candle is crafted with a bespoke fragrance carefully designed by master perfumers to enliven the spirit based on the personality traits identified in the astrological readings. In this candle, bottom notes of cedarwood, myrrh, and rosemary give way to a crisp middle note of mint and a top note of geranium flower. Poured With Love: Birthdate Candles are crafted with an all-natural blend of soy, coconut, and apricot wax and custom natural fragrance oils. The vessel is a reusable and recyclable premium glass jar with a 100% cotton wick. Hand-poured in small batches in the Northeast USA. Gifts They’ll Never Forget: From beautiful, scented candles that are individually crafted for every day of the year to custom hardcover books that illustrate unique astrological birth charts, Birthdate Co. crafts perfectly personalized treasures made just for you or your loved ones. It’s the perfect gift that says, \"I know you inside and out – and then some.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lqHPDVG6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Birthdate Co.","source_asin":"B0BW3F9TD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3F9TD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3F9TD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
