window.products.push({"id":263544,"name":"Samsung ME21H9900AS Chef Collection 2.1 Cu. Ft. Stainless Steel Over-the-Range MIcrowave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pOWE9nRjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This beautiful state-of-the-art Chef Collection microwave was inspired by insights from gourmet chefs and is a wonderful enhancement to any kitchen. Its smart sensor cooking setting automatically adjusts the cook time and power level based on real-time sensing so your food is cooked to perfection. Its polished ceramic interior resists scratches and stains and easily wipes clean. It also includes a quick-access commercial grade filter that captures 56% more oil than traditional filters.* *Compare to a Samsung Me16h702 filter.Chef Collection MicrowaveThe new Samsung Chef Collection Microwave is inspired by chefs insights and features sensor cook technology that automatically adjusts power levels so that cooking defrosting and reheating is perfect every time.Sensor CookUse preset buttons to cook your favorite foods for the best results. No more half-frozen foods or half-chilled soups. Get the right temperature with the push of a button.Ceramic Enamel InteriorOur ceramic enamel interior is scratch resistant and easy to clean. This durable ceramic enamel interior provides a polished surface that s easy to maintain. Effortlessly remove grease or oil from surfaces and protect against scratches that occur from daily use.Pro-Clean FilterThis commercial grade premium filter captures 56% more oil than traditional Otr filters.* Cook without worrying about smoke and odors. Easily remove and clean your filter with one touch. Regular cleaning is necessary to maintain optimal performance. *Compare to a Samsung Me16h702 filter.2.1 cu. ft. CapacityThe 2.1 cu. ft. capacity of this microwave accommodates large platters and dishes which typically do not fit in the average mid-size 1.5 cu. ft. microwave. A perfect option for larger families.Bottom ControlsThis microwave features precise touch controls with a premium look. A convenient location makes it easy to access cooking options. Glass controlled panel provides a seamless integrated design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pOWE9nRjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B00L8GLUUY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L8GLUUY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L8GLUUY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
