window.products.push({"id":263579,"name":"Flexzion Velvet Hanger 30 Pack - Non Slip Dress Hanger with Accessory Bar Space Saving, Strong and Durable with 360 Degree Swivel Hook, Contoured Shou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FBBrI6wML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How annoying is it to open your wardrobe each morning, to be greeted by an array of clothes that you can't really see because either they are stuffed in amongst other clothes, or are at a different height to the rest so hidden from view. And then, when you start to move things around, you have to be so careful not to disturb items that will fall from the hanger at the slightest thing. It's a minefield! It makes choosing an outfit not only more time consuming, but also less of a pleasure.These types of velvet hangers to be popular. They have a chrome hook and the body of the hanger is a thin plastic that has a flocked surface. Think of the inside of a jewelry box. This velvet like surface provides friction to prevent clothes from slipping. They also have little indentations to hold on to clothes with thin straps so your tanks and spaghetti strap dresses don't wind up on the floor every time you look at them funny. You can see that the shirts line up better when they're all on the same type of hanger. The collars and shoulders are more in alignment. The shirts also sit better on the hanger and don't move around when you hang them on the rod thanks to the non-slip velvet texture. It makes it easier to find the shirt you are looking for and the shirt doesn't slide around as you put it back on the rod. These are an affordable, space efficient and versatile clothing hanger style that you need in your closet. Specification: Color : Black Color : Black Size : 17.7 x 9.3 x 0.2 Inch / 430 X 23.30 X 0.6 CM Size : 17.7 x 9.3 x 0.2 Inch / 430 X 23.30 X 0.6 CM Materials: ABS & PP and velvet / Stainless steel hook Materials: ABS & PP and velvet / Stainless steel hook Quantity: 30pcs/box Quantity: 30pcs/box Package Content: 30 X Velvet Hanger - Non Slip Dress Hanger with Accessory Bar Space Saving, Strong and Durable with 360 Degree Chrome Swivel Hook, Contoured Shoulder for Women Men Shirts Clothes Coat Suit Pants 30 X Velvet Hanger - Non Slip Dress Hanger with Accessory Bar Space Saving, Strong and Durable with 360 Degree Chrome Swivel Hook, Contoured Shoulder for Women Men Shirts Clothes Coat Suit Pants","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FBBrI6wML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B079FF43MJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079FF43MJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079FF43MJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":263580,"name":"Blue Minyoki Matcha Bowl Ochawan with Periwinkle Brushstroke Design Made in Japan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jWl612G8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Minoyaki or Minoware refers to the great tradition and classical style of Japanese pottery. With a long history dating back over 1300 years, it is both an art form and a functional craft that produces practical items for daily use. It was certified as a traditional craftwork by The Ministry of International Trade and Industry in 1978. Minoyaki is a broad term that encompasses several styles of pottery with diverse colors, finishes, and enamels. Some famous examples of Minoyaki are as follows: Hino-Yaki is rich black or brown, warm and earthy. Oribe-Yaki is fresh with dark greens and less constraints on the traditional design. Kiseto-Yaki is known for light yellow and intriguing washes of green paints. Setokuro is glossy and black, achieved with quick high temperature firings. The name Minoyaki itself references the Mino region where it originated, located in the present-day Gifu Prefecture with high concentrations of Minoyaki artisans in Toki City, Tajimi City, Mizunami City, Kani City. Today the Mino region still produces over 50% of the pottery made in Japan. In the rich and complex world of Japanese arts and aesthetics, Minoyaki is of great cultural value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jWl612G8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yawhevg","source_asin":"B07JL11HYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JL11HYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JL11HYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
