window.products.push({"id":263804,"name":"Leggett & Platt Martinique Button-Tuft Upholstered Headboard with Adjustable Height, Putty Finish, Full / Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bkmGCdPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Martinique headboard combines soft, sweeping curves with straight lines to create an enduring transitional style. Constructed with a solid wood interior frame for stability and years of everyday use, this bedroom piece is upholstered in an Putty finished 100% polyester fabric. The button-tufted tailoring, so common to French décor, combined with the simple, yet sophisticated fabric, works together to marry traditional and contemporary designs. This elegant look is partnered with soft foam padding covering the sturdy, solid wood frame. The walnut finished headboard posts are also adjustable, allowing the user to change headboard levels from 54-inches to 58-inches to 62-inches in height. This (3) level option is a convenient way to create a new bedroom look with just the slightest headboard adjustment. A good ornamental headboard, like the Martinique, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard panel, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Martinique Headboard comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bkmGCdPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B00Q6PMBYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q6PMBYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Q6PMBYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
