window.products.push({"id":263929,"name":"4 Pcs Assorted Small Potted Succulents Arrangements Artificial Succulents in Grey Concrete Ceramic Planters with Geometric Pattern for Party Favor Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HEKXcqljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: This Collection includes set of 4 assorted small artificial potted succulent plant arrangements in box. The artificial greenery of Aloe, String of Pearls, Echeveria, Yucca, Jelly Bean, and Sedum Succulents are pre-potted in 4 pcs gray concrete ceramic pots. The concrete ceramic pots feature Mayan-inspired pattern with a Mid-century modern vibe. They will add a bit of chic nature and minimalist aesthetic to your home and office. The set of 4 potted succulent arrangements feature a variety of succulents in vibrant shades of green and purple. Assorted cute artificial succulents and pebbles are lifelike, arranged in grey round concrete ceramic planters with geometric pattern. This geometric design concrete planter has rows of geometric pattern in lighter color to showcase the textured detailing. This array of faux potted succulents adds a sense of modern simplistic styling to your space while bringing the natural feel. Material: Faux succulent arrangements are made of plastic and pre-potted in concrete ceramic pots with natural pebbles. These Concrete planters are made of gray concrete and each planter is unique and handmade. The sturdy composition of the concrete material will allow you to have the choice of placing the cement pots in the garden or indoors as you won't have to worry about them easily falling over. No watering or maintenance is needed for these artificial plants to stay fresh. Size: These small artificial potted succulent arrangements measure about 5.3\"-5.9\" wide and 5.3\"-10.2\" tall. Each cute concrete pot measures about 3.6\" wide and 2.7\" tall. Fake potted succulent arrangements can be displayed as a set or individually placed around your space. The compact size is great for limited spaces like tabletop, desktop, windowsill, and shelves. Small fake potted succulent arrangements add fresh charm to your desk, dining table, coffee table, windowsill, bookshelf, floating shelf, kitchen countertop, bathroom shelf, mantel, entryway table, cabinet, nightstand, and little corners of your house. They also make great housewarming gifts, birthday gifts, wedding favors, bridal/baby shower favors, party favors, Mother's Day gift, holiday gifts, sympathy gift, or presents for special events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HEKXcqljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B09JLS7M2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-263929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JLS7M2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JLS7M2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
